flowchart TD
    S[Incident selector
correlation / transition / launch / update / recovery / crash] --> C[Collect bounded diagnostic views]
    C --> E[Correlated operational events]
    C --> A[Relevant protected audit subset]
    C --> ST[State / transaction summaries]
    C --> ENV[Environment / compatibility summary]
    C --> O{Optional artifacts selected?}
    O -->|ETL| T[Detailed ETW trace]
    O -->|Crash dump| D[Selected WER dump]
    O -->|None| R[Redaction pipeline]
    E --> R
    A --> R
    ST --> R
    ENV --> R
    T --> R
    D --> R
    R --> V{Privacy validation passed?}
    V -->|No| X[Export blocked]
    V -->|Yes| M[manifest.json + summary.json]
    M --> Z[DiagnosticBundle.zip]
    Z --> L[Local export]
    Z --> U[Explicit support upload
requirements gated]
